  "methods_narrative": "QC-preprocessed Module 1 objects were concatenated on versionless Ensembl IDs using anndata.concat with join='inner'. Joint HVGs (n=2000) entered PCA (40 PCs). Donor effects were corrected with Harmony (harmonypy 2.0.0) on X_pca using batch key `donor_id`, max_iter_harmony=20, and random_state=0. Neighbors (n_neighbors=20) and UMAP (min_dist=0.25, spread=1.2) were recomputed on the Harmony embedding for visualization. Cell labels prefer `azimuth_label` for biological interpretation; Leiden (resolution=0.8) is always computed for diagnostic label-comparison panels, not only as a fallback. GTEx comparison is deferred to Module 4. Software: scanpy 1.11.5, anndata 0.12.19.",
